andomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLiu Jun and his younger brother have a good relationship, they like to share their food with each other. Today, Liu Jun buys a lemon, he wants to tease his younger brother, he tells his brother: \"This lemon is very sweet, you try it.\" His brother takes a bite, he feels uncomfortable because it is sour, but in order to let his brother also feel the sourness, he shows a happy expression and says to his brother: \"This lemon is really sweet, you don't believe it, you try it.\" His brother curiously tries it, he knows he gets tricked, it is sour.\n\n[Question]\nIs what the younger brother says true?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yes\nB. No","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":5.527680536849438E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52accc2ddb05a7fe2eedd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452172152,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6d721bcd981c4e9fb50dc8cddf6c9a26"}